WEBVTT

00:00:04.203 --> 00:00:05.736
Congratulations!

00:00:05.736 --> 00:00:07.976
You completed the course: Boosting

00:00:07.976 --> 00:00:11.040
Efficiency With Microsoft Copilot

00:00:11.040 --> 00:00:14.688
In this course, you learned that: Gen AI relies on

00:00:14.688 --> 00:00:19.660
Large Language Models (or LLMs) and foundation models.

00:00:20.320 --> 00:00:23.920
These are neural networks trained on vast amounts of data

00:00:23.920 --> 00:00:27.870
and can predict and generate content word by word.

00:00:28.530 --> 00:00:32.714
You Learned that Microsoft 365 Copilot is integrated

00:00:32.714 --> 00:00:37.418
directly into Microsoft 365 apps like Word, Excel,

00:00:37.418 --> 00:00:42.002
PowerPoint, Outlook, and Teams, turning these tools into

00:00:42.002 --> 00:00:44.910
powerhouses of creativity and productivity.

00:00:45.730 --> 00:00:48.458
You also learned the quality of Copilot’s

00:00:48.458 --> 00:00:51.938
output depends heavily on the clarity and

00:00:51.938 --> 00:00:54.026
structure of its prompts.

00:00:54.026 --> 00:00:56.194
And finally, you learned that

00:00:56.194 --> 00:00:59.730
maintaining data privacy is paramount.

00:00:59.730 --> 00:01:01.954
Ensure Copilot is integrated into

00:01:01.954 --> 00:01:05.170
secure, organization-approved environments.

00:01:05.170 --> 00:01:08.690
Always review and verify AI outputs to ensure

00:01:08.690 --> 00:01:11.690
they align with your intentions and ethical standards.